#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:5 80291540bdff4f6abe081085b3a7c0b3
msgid "Chat"
msgstr "聊天"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:7 3ad209de72984c2f83c47d26df70706d
msgid ""
"OpenAI's ChatGPT Assistants can be used to control an ArduPilot vehicle "
"using the chat module."
msgstr "可使用 OpenAI 的 ChatGPT Assistants 通过聊天模块控制 ArduPilot 飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:17 65a2c6a434a34e3ab3704d02ccd8fbf8
msgid ""
"This module is still under development and the assistant sometimes makes "
"mistakes including switching to the wrong flight mode or commanding target "
"positions that are many kilometers away."
msgstr "该模块仍在开发中，助手有时会出错，例如切换到错误的飞行模式或指定数千公里外的目标位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:20 f789424ad23c4805b29a9c70d5e02575
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:22 4f565f7e02cb4c288c1073247cdcea75
msgid "MAVProxy 1.8.69 (or higher)"
msgstr "MAVProxy 1.8.69（或更高版本）"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:23 c56f175f6cef41be82100547ca8f2345
msgid ""
"On Linux/Ubuntu the pyaudio and openai Python packages must be installed "
"manually"
msgstr "在 Linux/Ubuntu 上，必须手动安装 pyaudio 和 openai Python 包"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:24 17f0e7c7bea44bce8412dc69f56626c4
msgid ""
"`OpenAI API key  <https://platform.openai.com/docs/quickstart/account-"
"setup>`__"
msgstr ""
"`OpenAI API 密钥 <https://platform.openai.com/docs/quickstart/account-"
"setup>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:25 b24ac69763e0412494a835866606f253
msgid ""
"Set up the OpenAI Assistant (not required for core developers using "
"ArduPilot's API key)"
msgstr "设置 OpenAI Assistant（使用 ArduPilot API 密钥的核心开发者无需此步骤）"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:26 fb6b577f91a54f0185debe618698344e
msgid "Vehicle must be running ArduPilot 4.6 (or higher)"
msgstr "飞行器必须运行 ArduPilot 4.6（或更高版本）"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:29 29cdd0ab430a406c8f2273f6ad7de580
msgid "Installing Python Packages on Linux/Ubuntu"
msgstr "在 Linux/Ubuntu 上安装 Python 包"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:31 1d1a80b31d43403da242cf4006b9038c
msgid "From the command line run the following commands:"
msgstr "在命令行运行以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:33 d20868a81f66416e9d66e30ca67e0dea
msgid "sudo apt -y install python3-pyaudio"
msgstr "sudo apt -y install python3-pyaudio"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:34 74751dcc96884177938c75b459c76c19
msgid "python3 -m pip install openai"
msgstr "python3 -m pip install openai"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:37 9f78c47475c74857b5e8f45ebf072874
msgid "OpenAI API Key"
msgstr "OpenAI API 密钥"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:39 73b17d2010a541368136846d6eb4437f
msgid ""
"Details on how to get an API key are on the `OpenAI Account setup page  "
"<https://platform.openai.com/docs/quickstart/account-setup>`__.  ArduPilot "
"core developers can request a key in the \"dev-team-funding\" Discord "
"channel."
msgstr ""
"获取 API 密钥的详细说明请参阅 `OpenAI 账户设置页面 "
"<https://platform.openai.com/docs/quickstart/account-setup>`__。ArduPilot "
"核心开发者可在 Discord 频道 「dev-team-funding」 中申请密钥。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:41 df05b08680424ce9b830d0f9de1b5b74
msgid ""
"Once the API key has been obtained it can be used immediately by entering it"
" into the \"Menu\", \"Set API Key\" window."
msgstr "获得 API 密钥后，可立即在 「Menu」→「Set API Key」 窗口中输入并立即使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:45 a6ff43e8e9b2407ea6d6f65578f5cf6a
msgid ""
"With the above method the key is not stored permanently however meaning that"
" it must be re-entered each time MAVProxy is started. To store the key "
"permanently it should be added as an environment variable as described on "
"the `OpenAI Developer Quickstart page "
"<https://platform.openai.com/docs/quickstart?context=python>`__"
msgstr ""
"使用上述方法输入的密钥不会被永久保存，因此每次启动 MAVProxy 时都需要重新输入。如需永久保存密钥，应按照 `OpenAI 开发者快速入门页面 "
"<https://platform.openai.com/docs/quickstart?context=python>`__ "
"的说明将其添加为环境变量。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:48 454e96be3ba74d0db91c0da9375703bd
msgid ""
"On Linux/Ubuntu machines this can be done by adding the following line to "
"the end of the ~/.bashrc file (with \"XXXX\" replaced with your API key):"
msgstr "在 Linux/Ubuntu 系统上，可在 ~/.bashrc 文件末尾添加以下内容（将 「XXXX」替换为您的 API 密钥）："

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:54 1ced7ebd22cb46109f1ae69dd849388c
msgid "On Windows:"
msgstr "在 Windows 上："

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:56 220f09e2ee394867ad68ae5ff39fce1c
msgid "Right-click on 'This PC' or 'My Computer' and select 'Properties'."
msgstr "右键点击 「此电脑」 或 「我的电脑」，选择 「属性」。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:57 cbf68a7e489247f680b417c7538679b4
msgid "Click on 'Advanced system settings'."
msgstr "点击 「高级系统设置」。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:58 beca72efb1c0472594e57e4a0d7800e6
msgid "Click the 'Environment Variables' button."
msgstr "点击 「环境变量」 按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:59 b8f5cee2b2c144a8a5df9cddad6b427c
msgid ""
"In the 'System variables' section, click 'New...' and enter OPENAI_API_KEY "
"as the variable name and your API key as the variable value."
msgstr "在 「系统变量」 区域，点击 「新建...」，变量名输入 OPENAI_API_KEY，变量值输入您的 API 密钥。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:62 5fa33cd56e984bf7b9f769cd838594c8
msgid "Assistant Setup"
msgstr "助手设置"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:64 fc3f265107b94df6af3d74998aef1b71
msgid ""
"This section is only required for users who are not using the ArduPilot "
"OpenAI API key."
msgstr "本节仅适用于未使用 ArduPilot OpenAI API 密钥的用户。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:66 e698cc7acfb74805b9f968bdcab74e27
msgid ""
"Download the contents of the `mavproxy_chat / assistant_setup "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MAVProxy/tree/master/MAVProxy/modules/mavproxy_chat/assistant_setup>`__"
" directory"
msgstr ""
"下载 `mavproxy_chat / assistant_setup "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MAVProxy/tree/master/MAVProxy/modules/mavproxy_chat/assistant_setup>`__"
" 目录中的内容"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:67 89f8340cc8704caba82cee59585a5501
msgid "run the setup.py script"
msgstr "运行 setup.py 脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:73 ec838d2324e14a8f8a9b65e6b0aea7db
msgid ""
"Open the `OpenAI Assistants <https://platform.openai.com/assistants>`__ page"
" and confirm that the \"ArduPilot Vehicle Control via MAVLink\" assistant "
"has been created"
msgstr ""
"打开 `OpenAI Assistants <https://platform.openai.com/assistants>`__ 页面，确认已创建 "
"「ArduPilot Vehicle Control via MAVLink」 助手"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:76 7932b5561ceb42cd99f6683bef1a20e8
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "使用方法"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:78 b9d934354ee548338ef2e20b3aa3f26d
msgid ""
"Start MAVProxy and in the console enter \"module load chat\".  The chat "
"window should appear as shown below."
msgstr "启动 MAVProxy，在控制台输入 「module load chat」。聊天窗口应如下图所示出现。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:82 296b08eca9d54f90a3f7ed0b6accc066
msgid ""
"Text can be typed into the upper text input area and sent to the assistant "
"by pressing the \"Send\" button or by pressing the \"Enter\" key"
msgstr "可在上方文本输入框中输入文字，然后点击 「Send」 按钮或按 「Enter」 键发送给助手"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:83 0986eda264e74c25aa1b32f9da724d84
msgid ""
"If the Rec button is pressed 5 seconds of audio are recorded, transcribed to"
" text and then sent to the assistant"
msgstr "按下 Rec 按钮后，将录制 5 秒音频并转录为文本发送给助手"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:84 e9346c0a7b5b41bab45467c35a5733ff
msgid ""
"In the bottom text area the user's input is shown in red and the assistant's"
" response is shown in black"
msgstr "在下方文本区域，用户输入以红色显示，助手回复以黑色显示"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:87 57f5f3bbb70641baa82f8f9198e4d7df
msgid "Sample Conversation"
msgstr "示例对话"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:89 c44a790cda704f25a96291b216b8c876
msgid "**Please takeoff to 50m**"
msgstr "**请起飞至 50 米**"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:91 27cf24ca48ba49f690c9d4938fcc6ce9
msgid ""
"*The vehicle has been switched to Guided mode and given a takeoff command to"
" reach an altitude of 50 meters above the home position.*"
msgstr "*飞行器已切换至 Guided 模式，并已发出起飞指令，目标高度为距 home 点 50 米。*"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:93 61bc1ef1ba2c488b9beff6ddd8219b7b
msgid "**Please set the disarm delay to 0**"
msgstr "**请将解锁延迟设为 0**"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:95 e7b6f915fd7544149f2b92a9ce440c82
msgid "*The disarm delay has been set to 0 seconds for the Copter.*"
msgstr "*Copter 的解锁延迟已设置为 0 秒。*"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:97 305870eae4204c9f940de069e95e26f6
msgid "**the takeoff failed, please try again**"
msgstr "**起飞失败，请重试**"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:99 479b7a0c75484d859ee0a0ffd2423b3c
msgid ""
"*I have sent the takeoff command again to reach an altitude of 50 meters "
"above the home position.*"
msgstr "*已再次发出起飞指令，目标高度为距 home 点 50 米。*"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:101 71a01f3f0aef4d3a998ba5fc9fe50a1e
msgid "**please fly West 100m**"
msgstr "**请向西飞行 100 米**"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:103 9307fcc696e440c6857cc62f37d4f37a
msgid ""
"*The Copter has been commanded to fly 100 meters to the West at an altitude "
"of 50 meters above home.*"
msgstr "*Copter 已被指令以距 home 点 50 米的高度向西飞行 100 米。*"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:105 707bf38882ba4df481a250c1bd9bb1d6
msgid "**well done, can you return home now?**"
msgstr "**干得好，现在能返航吗？**"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/chat.rst:107 48fb3983c04543a8b7b3318a86127b51
msgid ""
"*The Copter has been commanded to return to the launch (home) location.*"
msgstr "*Copter 已被指令返回起飞（home）位置。*"
